flowchart LR
    Root["JWT Authentication & Role Claims"] --> Guest["GUEST / MEMBER / VIP_MEMBER"]
    Root --> Waiter["WAITER (Phục vụ)"]
    Root --> Kitchen["KITCHEN / HEAD_CHEF / BARISTA_LEAD"]
    Root --> Cashier["CASHIER (Thu ngân)"]
    Root --> Manager["MANAGER (Quản lý)"]
    Root --> Admin["ADMIN (Quản trị tối cao)"]

    Guest --> G1["Menu, Category Filter, Cart, Checkout"]
    Guest --> G2["Loyalty Points, Redeem Voucher, Order Lookup"]
    Guest --> G3["Profile, Email OTP, OAuth Sign-In"]

    Waiter --> W1["Floor & Table Map (Open/Transfer/Merge/Split/Reserve)"]
    Waiter --> W2["Menu + Add Items + Offline Queue Sync"]

    Kitchen --> K1["KDS Screen (Pending -> Cooking -> Ready -> Served)"]
    Kitchen --> K2["Kitchen Void Item & 1-Tap Toggle Sold-Out"]

    Cashier --> C1["POS Split-Screen / Mobile Tab Terminal"]
    Cashier --> C2["Manual Discount + Cash / VietQR / Split Pay / VNPay"]
    Cashier --> C3["Shift Open Float / Close & Print Z-Report"]

    Manager --> M1["All Ops + Category & Product CRUD + Image Upload"]
    Manager --> M2["Order Analytics Dashboard + Non-Admin Role Assignment"]

    Admin --> A1["Full Manager Access + Lock/Unlock Any Account + Assign ADMIN"]
